00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:36.980
It is.

00:00:36.980 --> 00:00:37.870
It's so good.

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.950
- I don't think I've ever
actually said that sentence

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:41.520
in my entire existence.

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.260
I think I'm like elf,

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:46.290
like, I'm like if there's sugar I'm in.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.320
- Same, same.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.240
- Yeah.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:51.430
Okay, so you did this
crazy thing on TikTok,

00:00:51.430 --> 00:00:53.770
